老人了，如果不是他把媚儿变成西夏圣女的模样，媚儿也不可能这么顺利的拥有一个新的身份，那么想要重回商离天身边，简直是比登天还难。西夏王顺民意接圣女回宫之后，便忽然病倒，与此同时，商国商离天也突然派使者前来和亲，且亲笔点名要圣女！原因是，商国皇后身体一直欠佳，未能给商离天诞下子嗣，而商离天又独宠皇后一人，不肯纳姬妾，举国上下都为之担忧不已，担心商离天后继无人！前些日子，国师算过，说皇上一定要纳一个处于西方，而且是天下最纯洁的女子为妃，借她的运势，才能助皇后怀上龙裔。而这天下处于西方的就只有西夏国，而西夏人眼中最纯洁的女子莫过于圣女，皇后极力赞成国师的说法，终于劝通商离天派人前来和亲。当然这一切并非巧合，而是媚儿精心策划的一场回归阴谋！西夏王突病，由世子夏寒轩暂代国事，而他一直就钟情于圣女媚儿，如今事事都经他做主，他如何肯将媚儿嫁于商离天，连驳数道谏折，亦不肯下旨！商国使者离开时恨恨地放言，若西夏不肯让圣女前去和亲，那么，五日之后，商国将举兵来犯！“商离天真是欺人太甚！”夏寒轩将那些奏折用力地掷到地上，商离天娶哪一个女人，他都没有意见，可偏偏要娶的却是他心爱的女人，叫他如何不怒！媚儿刚一走进去，便看到了散落满地的奏折，暗暗拧眉，但还是弯腰将散落一地的奏折一本本地捡了起来，并示意一旁的人都退下去！她重新将奏折放到龙案上，轻轻走到夏寒轩身后，柔声劝道：“寒轩哥哥，下旨吧！不要让媚儿成为西夏的罪人！”口里虽然说得温婉至极，可是，心底却是将夏寒轩骂了个够：这头蠢猪！还不下旨，破坏了她的计划，她就一刀解决了他！夏寒轩一听到她的声音，霍地转身，冲动之下将她紧紧拥在怀中：“不！媚儿，你是知道的，我一直都喜欢你，我怎么舍得将你嫁走？”媚儿冒西夏圣女重生，但并没有前圣女的记忆，所以她就假装失忆，不过，这只能骗过夏寒轩他们而已。西夏王曾密见媚儿，当面就揭穿了她假圣女的身份，只是，最后却与她达成协议，他答应让媚儿以圣女的身份去商国，而媚儿也答应他，到了商国之后，替他办妥一件事情。本来一切都在媚儿的计划中，可偏偏夏寒轩这头猪就是不肯下旨，气得她真想一刀结果了他！媚儿现在拥有的是狐女的心，所以，她懂读心术！夏寒轩一靠近她，她就知道了他心底在想什么，原来这个男人一直喜欢圣女，难怪他一直不肯下旨！今天加一更～～简介上面有些投票支持，宝贝们看别忘了给投票票哦；你们的支持就是俺更新的动力～～", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/dizhenhuanzhizuidufeifei/8.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "The first hatred of genocide The kind and enthusiastic people of Xixia have been singing and dancing these days, and everyone's face is filled with deep joy, because their saint who has been dead for three years has actually broken out of the coffin and resurrected! They believed in Allah and believed that Allah had appeared and resurrected the saint. This was an auspicious sign from heaven, which meant that Xixia would be prosperous for all generations. Of course, the resurrection of the Xixia Saint is just an illusion created by Xiaoxian and Ling Feng. The purpose is to allow Meier to stay in Xixia legitimately and then return to the Shang Kingdom in the name of the Xixia Saint. And all this is thanks to the old man Wuhui. If he hadn't turned Mei'er into the appearance of the Xixia Saint, Mei'er would not have had a new identity so smoothly. Then it would be harder than climbing to the sky to return to Shang Litian. After the king of Xixia followed the popular will and took the saint back to the palace, he suddenly fell ill. At the same time, Shang Litian of the Shang Kingdom suddenly sent an envoy to come for the marriage and personally requested the saint by name! The reason is that the Queen of Shang Kingdom has been in poor health and has not been able to give birth to an heir for Shang Litian. Shang Litian also favors the queen alone and refuses to take concubines. The whole country is worried about this, fearing that Shang Litian will have no successor! A few days ago, the Imperial Master made calculations and said that the Emperor must accept a woman from the West who is the purest in the world as his concubine. Only with her luck can he help the Queen conceive the Dragonborn. The only country in the world that is in the west is the Xixia Kingdom, and the purest woman in the eyes of the Xixia people is the saint. The queen strongly agreed with the state teacher's statement, and finally persuaded Tong Shang and Li Tian to send someone to come and make peace. Of course, all this is not a coincidence, but a return conspiracy carefully planned by Meier! The King of Xixia suddenly fell ill, and his son Xia Hanxuan temporarily took charge of state affairs. He had always been in love with the saint Meier, and now that everything was decided by him, how could he be willing to marry Meier to Shang Litian, despite repeated remonstrances and refusals to issue an edict! When the Shang envoy left, he said bitterly that if Xixia refused to allow the saint to come and make peace, then in five days, the Shang State would invade! \"Shang Litian is going too far!\" Xia Hanxuan threw the memorials to the ground hard. He had no objection to which woman Shang Litian married, but the one he wanted to marry was the woman he loved. How could he not be angry! As soon as Mei'er walked in, she saw the memorials scattered on the floor. She frowned secretly, but she still bent down and picked up the memorials scattered on the floor one by one, and motioned for everyone on the side to step back! She put the memorial on the dragon table again, walked gently behind Xia Hanxuan, and persuaded softly: \"Brother Hanxuan, give the decree! Don't let Meier become Xixia's sinner!\" Although she said it very gently, in her heart she scolded Xia Hanxuan enough: this stupid pig! He didn't even give the order and ruined her plan, so she killed him with one blow! As soon as Xia Hanxuan heard her voice, he turned around and hugged her tightly in his arms impulsively: \"No! Meier, you know that I have always liked you, how could I be willing to marry you away?\" Meier pretended that the Saint of Xixia was reborn, but had no memory of the former Saint, so she pretended to have amnesia, but this could only deceive Xia Hanxuan and the others. The King of Xixia once met Meier secretly and exposed her identity as a fake saint in person. However, he finally reached an agreement with her. He promised to let Meier go to the Shang Kingdom as a saint, and Meier also promised him that she would complete something for him after arriving in the Shang Kingdom. Everything was originally planned by Meier, but Xia Hanxuan, a pig, just refused to give the order, which made her so angry that she really wanted to kill him with a knife! Meier now has the heart of a fox girl, so she knows how to read minds! As soon as Xia Hanxuan approached her, she knew what he was thinking in his heart. It turned out that this man had always liked the saint. No wonder he had refused to give orders! I’ll add an update today~~ There are some votes in the introduction, dear friends, don’t forget to vote; your support is the motivation for my update~~", "title_en": "Chapter 8"}